{"reviewId": "383579453_87xUlYGpf", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "从时间节点来看，各个国家的发展路径不一样，康波周期也有些不同，但是自从21世纪之后，各个国家的康波周期就逐渐同步了，可能是全球化的影响，因为全球化使得国家之间的联系以及贸易更加紧密了。\n\n就比如现在，各个国家之间的就业都不容易", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "而在其后的30年里，对康波的研究一直沉寂，想来那是第四次康波的繁荣阶段。20世纪70年代之后，对康波的研究再度活跃，而这肯定源于第四次康波进入了衰退和萧条阶段", "range": "1780-1859", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "383579453_87xUlYGpf", "userVid": 383579453, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773298183, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 383579453, "name": "子瑜", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-Ngun9wIHpHhjWkwo8JlcId3/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "子瑜", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "看书思考", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "往者不可谏 来者犹可追", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241125-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "唯有中国所处阶段不同", "reviewId": "383579453_87xUlYGpf", "commentId": "383579453_87xUlYGpf_c223635575_8bJCYP6J7", "userVid": 223635575, "createTime": 1788050327, "author": {"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc":